name    mod-dungeon-challenge: a full boss clear of Turtle Gilneas City (815) completes the run
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Gilneas City is staged `enabled = 0` in dungeon_challenge_dungeons with
# boss_count 8; this checks the boss list (dungeon_challenge_boss_entry plus rank 3) before it is enabled: the
# director kills every listed boss with `.die` in a level-1 run (uplift 80); the run must end cleared, with every kill
# credited. `.dchallenge start` only knows enabled dungeons: the test window sets `enabled = 1` and restarts, and a
# dungeon whose scenario fails goes back to `enabled = 0`.
timeout 300s

bot a warrior
group party

place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
require a alive
as gm .cheat god on
as gm .dchallenge start 815 1
expect output has "starting"
waitfor gm map 815 timeout 20s
wait 2s

log boss 1 - holtz (930125)
do gm goto -1100.3 2332.6 183.7
wait 2s
pick holtz creature:930125 near gm
require holtz exists
do gm target holtz
as gm .die
waitfor holtz dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 2 - rage (930126)
do gm goto -1288.2 2221.5 184.2
wait 2s
pick rage creature:930126 near gm
require rage exists
do gm target rage
as gm .die
waitfor rage dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 3 - judge (930127)
do gm goto -1475.2 2321.6 186.3
wait 2s
pick judge creature:930127 near gm
require judge exists
do gm target judge
as gm .die
waitfor judge dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 4 - dusti (930128)
do gm goto -1450.7 2567.1 183.7
wait 2s
pick dusti creature:930128 near gm
require dusti exists
do gm target dusti
as gm .die
waitfor dusti dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 5 - magnus (930129)
do gm goto -1061.8 2805.4 183.2
wait 2s
pick magnus creature:930129 near gm
require magnus exists
do gm target magnus
as gm .die
waitfor magnus dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 6 - levvin (930134)
do gm goto -947.5 2927.1 134.9
wait 2s
pick levvin creature:930134 near gm
require levvin exists
do gm target levvin
as gm .die
waitfor levvin dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 7 - celia (930114)
do gm goto -962.3 2949.4 167.3
wait 2s
pick celia creature:930114 near gm
require celia exists
do gm target celia
as gm .die
waitfor celia dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 8 - mortimer (930115)
do gm goto -956.4 2957.2 167.3
wait 2s
pick mortimer creature:930115 near gm
require mortimer exists
do gm target mortimer
as gm .die
waitfor mortimer dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 9 - genn (930124)
do gm goto -942.8 2968.6 213.2
wait 2s
pick genn creature:930124 near gm
require genn exists
do gm target genn
as gm .die
waitfor genn dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log the run ended cleared with every boss credited
as gm .dchallenge status
expect output has "bosses 8/8"
expect output has "state 7"

cleanup
as gm .cheat god off
place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
